
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#f8f7f4">
<meta name="description" content="View original artwork and enquire through Kaalaverse.">
<title>Artwork Details | Kaalaverse</title>

<style>
:root{
 --paper:#f8f7f4;--white:#fff;--ink:#171713;--muted:#77766f;
 --line:#e8e5de;--accent:#a66d43;--dark:#24231f;
 --serif:Georgia,serif;--sans:Arial,sans-serif;--max:1200px
}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth;scroll-padding-top:90px}
body{margin:0;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);font-family:var(--sans)}
a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
button,input,textarea{font:inherit}
button{cursor:pointer}
.wrap{width:min(var(--max),calc(100% - 48px));margin:auto}
.topbar{background:var(--dark);color:#e8dfd3;text-align:center;padding:9px;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:2px}
header{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:20;background:#f8f7f4ed;backdrop-filter:blur(12px);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.nav{height:76px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px}
.logo{font-size:25px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-1.5px}
.logo span{color:var(--accent)}
.navlinks{display:flex;gap:22px}
.navlinks a{font-size:12px;font-weight:600}
.navlinks a:hover{color:var(--accent)}
.nav-actions{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:15px}
.login{border:1px solid var(--ink);border-radius:30px;padding:10px 17px;font-size:12px}
.menu{display:none;border:0;background:none;font-size:25px}
.mobile-menu{display:none;padding:0 0 18px;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}
.mobile-menu.open{display:grid}
.mobile-menu a{font-size:13px;padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}

.breadcrumb{padding:25px 0;font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)}
.breadcrumb a:hover{color:var(--accent)}
.product{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:55px;padding-bottom:75px}
.gallery{min-width:0}
.main-image{height:570px;background:#e9e5dc;position:relative;overflow:hidden;cursor:zoom-in}
.main-image img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}
.zoom-label{position:absolute;bottom:15px;right:15px;background:#fff;padding:10px 13px;font-size:10px}
.thumbnails{display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:14px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.thumb{width:85px;height:85px;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:0;background:#e9e5dc;overflow:hidden}
.thumb img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}
.thumb.active{border:2px solid var(--accent)}
.product-info{padding-top:12px}
.eyebrow{color:var(--accent);font-size:10px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase}
.product-info h1{font:500 clamp(35px,4vw,51px)/1.12 var(--serif);margin:15px 0}
.description{font-size:13px;line-height:1.9;color:var(--muted)}
.artist-box{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:15px;padding:18px 0;margin:22px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.artist-avatar{width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:50%;overflow:hidden;background:#e9e5dc;flex-shrink:0}
.artist-avatar img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}
.artist-box small{display:block;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:var(--muted);text-transform:uppercase}
.artist-box strong{display:block;font:500 19px var(--serif);margin-top:5px}
.price-label{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:1.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)}
.price{font:500 29px var(--serif);margin:9px 0}
.price-note{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.7}
.actions{display:flex;gap:11px;margin-top:25px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.btn{padding:15px 21px;border:1px solid var(--ink);font-size:11px;font-weight:700;display:inline-flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center}
.btn-dark{background:var(--ink);color:white}
.btn-dark:hover{background:var(--accent);border-color:var(--accent)}
.btn-outline{background:transparent}
.btn-outline:hover{background:#eeeae2}
.wishlist{width:48px;height:48px;background:white;border:1px solid var(--line);font-size:21px}
.wishlist.saved{color:#a33b35}
.detail-note{margin-top:27px;background:#eeeae2;padding:18px;font-size:11px;line-height:1.8;color:#625e56}
.details-section{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:55px 0}
.details-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:50px}
.details-section h2{font:500 34px var(--serif);margin:10px 0 17px}
.details-section p{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.9}
.spec-list{border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
.spec{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;padding:15px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);font-size:12px}
.spec span:first-child{color:var(--muted)}
.spec span:last-child{text-align:right}

footer{background:var(--dark);color:white;padding:48px 0 22px}
.footer-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:2fr 1fr 1fr;gap:35px}
.footer-grid p{color:#bbb6ad;font-size:12px;line-height:1.9;max-width:350px}
.footer-grid strong{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:2px;color:#d5b292}
.footer-grid a:not(.logo){display:block;color:#c8c4bb;font-size:12px;margin-top:13px}
.copyright{border-top:1px solid #ffffff25;padding-top:18px;margin-top:35px;color:#aaa59d;font-size:10px}

.modal{display:none;position:fixed;inset:0;background:#171713df;z-index:60;padding:18px;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
.modal.open{display:flex}
.modal-box{width:min(560px,100%);max-height:90vh;overflow:auto;background:var(--paper);padding:28px;position:relative}
.modal-close{position:absolute;right:15px;top:12px;border:0;background:none;font-size:25px}
.modal-box h2{font:500 30px var(--serif);margin:12px 0}
.modal-box p{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.7}
.form-row{margin:14px 0}
.form-row label{display:block;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:7px}
.form-row input,.form-row textarea{width:100%;padding:12px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:white;outline:none}
.form-row textarea{min-height:100px;resize:vertical}
.form-row input:focus,.form-row textarea:focus{border-color:var(--accent)}
.form-submit{width:100%;padding:14px;border:0;background:var(--ink);color:white;font-size:11px;font-weight:700}
.status{display:none;font-size:12px;color:#356b45;margin-top:13px;line-height:1.7}

.lightbox{display:none;position:fixed;inset:0;background:#090909ed;z-index:70;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:20px}
.lightbox.open{display:flex}
.lightbox img{max-width:95%;max-height:90vh;width:auto;object-fit:contain}
.lightbox button{position:absolute;right:25px;top:20px;background:none;border:0;color:white;font-size:35px}

@media(max-width:950px){
 .navlinks{display:none}.menu{display:block}
 .product{gap:30px}
 .main-image{height:470px}
}
@media(max-width:650px){
 .wrap{width:calc(100% - 32px)}
 .nav{height:68px}.logo{font-size:22px}
 .breadcrumb{padding:19px 0}
 .product{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:25px;padding-bottom:45px}
 .main-image{height:390px}
 .product-info{padding-top:5px}
 .product-info h1{font-size:38px}
 .details-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:25px}
 .details-section{padding:40px 0}
 .footer-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:25px}
 .footer-grid>div:first-child{grid-column:span 2}
 .actions .btn{flex:1}
}
@media(max-width:390px){.main-image{height:320px}.thumb{width:70px;height:70px}}
</style>
</head>

<body>
<div class="topbar">ORIGINAL ART · CREATIVE EXPRESSION · KAALAVERSE</div>

<header>
<div class="wrap nav">
<a class="logo" href="index.html">KAALA<span>VERSE</span></a>
<nav class="navlinks">
<a href="index.html">Home</a>
<a href="discover-artists.html">Discover Artists</a>
<a href="explore-art.html">Explore Art</a>
<a href="subscriptions.html">Memberships</a>
<a href="live-events.html">Live Events</a>
</nav>
<div class="nav-actions">
<a href="explore-art.html" class="login">Back to Art</a>
</div>
<button class="menu" onclick="toggleMenu()" aria-label="Open menu">☰</button>
</div>
<div class="wrap mobile-menu" id="mobileMenu">
<a href="index.html">Home</a>
<a href="discover-artists.html">Discover Artists</a>
<a href="explore-art.html">Explore Art</a>
<a href="subscriptions.html">Memberships</a>
<a href="live-events.html">Live Events</a>
<a href="artist-booking.html">Book an Artist</a>
</div>
</header>

<main>
<div class="wrap">
<div class="breadcrumb">
<a href="index.html">Home</a> / 
<a href="explore-art.html">Explore Art</a> /
<span>Artwork Details</span>
</div>

<section class="product">
<div class="gallery">
<div class="main-image" id="mainImage">
<img id="productImage" src="assets/client-image-3.jpg" alt="Artwork image">
<span class="zoom-label">Click image to enlarge ↗</span>
</div>
<div class="thumbnails" id="thumbnails">
<button class="thumb active" data-image="assets/client-image-3.jpg" aria-label="View image 1">
<img src="assets/client-image-3.jpg" alt="">
</button>
<button class="thumb" data-image="assets/client-image-5.jpg" aria-label="View image 2">
<img src="assets/client-image-5.jpg" alt="">
</button>
</div>
</div>

<div class="product-info">
<div class="eyebrow" id="productCategory">Kaalaverse Art Collection</div>
<h1 id="productTitle">Artwork Details</h1>
<p class="description" id="productDescription">
Discover this artwork from the Kaalaverse collection. Contact us for verified artwork information, availability and further details.
</p>

<div class="artist-box">
<div class="artist-avatar">
<img src="assets/client-image-3.jpg" alt="Artist photography">
</div>
<div>
<small>Artist / Creator</small>
<strong id="artistName">Kaalaverse Creator</strong>
</div>
</div>

<div class="price-label">Artwork Price</div>
<div class="price" id="productPrice">Price on enquiry</div>
