<div class="actions">
<button class="btn btn-dark" id="enquireButton">Enquire About Artwork ↗</button>
<button class="wishlist" id="wishlistButton" type="button" aria-label="Add to wishlist" aria-pressed="false">♡</button>
</div>

<div class="detail-note">
Artwork information, price and availability should be confirmed with the artist before any purchase. Online payment and checkout will be connected after backend integration.
</div>
</div>
</section>
</div>

<section class="details-section">
<div class="wrap details-grid">
<div>
<div class="eyebrow">About this artwork</div>
