<div class="eyebrow">Artwork information</div>
<h2>Details & specifications</h2>
<div class="spec-list">
<div class="spec"><span>Category</span><span id="specCategory">To be confirmed</span></div>
<div class="spec"><span>Artist</span><span id="specArtist">To be confirmed</span></div>
<div class="spec"><span>Medium</span><span>Contact artist</span></div>
