<footer>
<div class="wrap">
<div class="footer-grid">
<div>
<a class="logo" href="index.html">KAALA<span>VERSE</span></a>
<p>Discover creators. Shop original art. Subscribe to artists. Book performers. Experience live entertainment.</p>
</div>
<div>
<strong>EXPLORE</strong>
<a href="index.html">Home</a>
